1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,600
UNPERFORMED: imagine something, then direct its existence.

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:04,700
IMAGINE: write the idea in plain language. Demo mode uses deterministic rules; no AI model is called.

3
00:00:04,700 --> 00:00:07,700
COMPOSE: the idea becomes a typed, validated Performance Score.

4
00:00:07,700 --> 00:00:10,700
Constraints stay proposals until a human approves them.

5
00:00:10,700 --> 00:00:11,650
NEGOTIATE: ask for a change in your own words.

6
00:00:11,650 --> 00:00:15,250
The director objects once, with a reason: hold the light back for 8 beats first.

7
00:00:15,250 --> 00:00:17,850
Or combine both ideas. Every option shows exactly what it changes.

8
00:00:17,850 --> 00:00:20,250
The human decides. Authority rules are enforced by deterministic code, not by the model.

9
00:00:20,250 --> 00:00:23,650
REHEARSE: scrub the timeline and adjust any section by hand.

10
00:00:23,650 --> 00:00:42,250
PERFORM: a real-time 3D stage with procedural audio.

11
00:00:42,250 --> 00:00:47,250
A human can step in at any moment: blackout, pause, master intensity.

12
00:01:02,750 --> 00:01:10,250
The climax holds the light back, then releases: the choice made in negotiation.

13
00:01:15,250 --> 00:01:24,317
The ending the human locked: complete silence.

14
00:01:24,817 --> 00:01:27,217
REVIEW: a factual record of who decided what, and what changed.

15
00:01:27,217 --> 00:01:29,017
Captured from the running app in demo mode. github.com/joojoohappy/Unperformed
